### Freelancer Dashboard Statistics API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### ============================================
### GET FREELANCER DASHBOARD STATISTICS
### ============================================
### Get statistics for the authenticated freelancer including:
### - Offers (عروض): Total proposals and percentage of accepted proposals
### - Ratings (تقييمات): Total reviews received and completion percentage
### - Projects (مشاريع): Total projects and percentage of completed projects
### - Contracts (عقود): Total contracts and percentage of approved/completed contracts
### 
### Requires: User authentication (JWT token)
### Returns: Dashboard statistics with counts and percentages

GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/dashboard-stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Example with actual token:
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/dashboard-stats
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ============================================
### RESPONSE FORMAT
### ============================================

### Success Response (200 OK):
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Freelancer dashboard stats fetched successfully",
###   "data": {
###     "offers": {
###       "count": 12,
###       "percentage": 80
###     },
###     "ratings": {
###       "count": 8,
###       "percentage": 90
###     },
###     "projects": {
###       "count": 5,
###       "percentage": 60
###     },
###     "contracts": {
###       "count": 3,
###       "percentage": 40
###     }
###   }
### }

### Error Response - Unauthorized (401):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "Unauthorized"
### }

### Error Response - User Not Found (404):
### {
###   "success": false,
###   "message": "User not found"
### }

### ============================================
### STATISTICS EXPLANATION
### ============================================

### 1. OFFERS (عروض)
###    - count: Total number of proposals created by the freelancer
###    - percentage: Percentage of proposals that were accepted
###    - Calculation: (accepted proposals / total proposals) * 100

### 2. RATINGS (تقييمات)
###    - count: Total number of reviews received by the freelancer
###    - percentage: Percentage of completed contracts that have reviews
###    - Calculation: (reviews received / completed contracts) * 100
###    - Capped at 100%

### 3. PROJECTS (مشاريع)
###    - count: Total number of unique projects the freelancer is working on (through contracts)
###    - percentage: Percentage of projects that are completed
###    - Calculation: (completed projects / total projects) * 100

### 4. CONTRACTS (عقود)
###    - count: Total number of contracts for the freelancer
###    - percentage: Percentage of contracts that are approved and completed
###    - Calculation: (approved contracts / total contracts) * 100
###    - Approved contracts require: status='approved', clientapproval=true, freelancerapproval=true

### ============================================
### NOTES & GUIDELINES
### ============================================

### 1. AUTHENTICATION
###    - This endpoint requires a valid JWT token in the Authorization header
###    - Format: Authorization: Bearer <your-jwt-token>
###    - Get token from: POST /api/auth/verify-otp

### 2. USER CONTEXT
###    - Statistics are calculated for the authenticated user (from JWT token)
###    - No need to pass user ID in the request
###    - Works for any authenticated user, but designed for freelancers

### 3. DATA ACCURACY
###    - All statistics are calculated in real-time from the database
###    - Percentages are rounded to the nearest integer
###    - Zero counts return 0% percentage (except ratings which may show 100% if reviews exist)

### 4. PERFORMANCE
###    - The endpoint performs multiple database queries
###    - Consider caching if this endpoint is called frequently
###    - Response time depends on the number of proposals, contracts, and projects

###